  "prefLabel": "He-P 3008.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 3008.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to describe the requirements for the screening of all newborns pursuant to RSA 132:10-a, RSA 132:10-aa, and for newborn hearing screening pursuant to RSA 132:10-b, V.\n\nSource. #8529, eff 12-23-05; ss by #9725, eff 7-1-10; ss by #12632, eff 9-28-18; ss by #13530, eff 1-25-23",
